<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>E-commerce Activation Email</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #222222;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        a {
            color: #000;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        p {
            margin: 0 0 15px;
        }
        table td {
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            
        }
        .email-header {
            background-color: aqua;
            padding: 24px;
            color: #ffffff
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 24px;
             background-color: #ffffff;

        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding :24px
        }
        .button {
            background-color: blue;
            display: inline-block;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px ;
            border-radius: 4px;
            
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>Welcome to E-commerce</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="email-body">
            <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

            <p>
                Thank you for registering on our platform.  
                To activate your seller account, please use the following activation code.
            </p>
            <h2><%= otp%></h2>
            <p>
                Please enter this code on the activation page within the next 5 minutes
            </p>
            <p>
                if you did not register for a E-commerce account, please ignore this email
            </p>

       
        </div>

        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>if you have any questions, please contact our support team. <a href="mailto:kajevic18@gmail.com">Contact Support</a></p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>